set ::env(//_antenna_history) "MEASURED LADDER. run_2 (no heuristic, 1 GRT pass): 129 pin / 86 net antenna, 950 diodes, 0 slew, 0 fanout. run_4 (threshold 90 + deprecated DIODE_INSERTION_STRATEGY 3): 9/9 antenna but 22826 diodes, 687 slew, 2151 fanout - a diode on ~every input pin doubles each net's pin count and is added AFTER the resizer, so nothing repairs the damage. run_5 (threshold 250): 29/29 antenna, 6654 diodes, 621 slew, 726 fanout (604 data + 122 clock). run_6 (threshold 200, below) is the next step: run_5's 29 violations are all marginal - worst ratio 2.09, 28 of 29 below 1.75 - so a modest drop should clear most of them without returning to run_4's diode flood."
